<title>JAPAN: Anritsu files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Anritsu files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anritsu Corp said on Monday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 30 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from April 19, it said.</p>
<p>Anritsu is a leading manufacturer of electronic equipment.</p>
</text>
